      'look down, the classic flight style. <b>Horizontal</b> flips left and right. <b>Both</b> flips both.',
    /* D375: dpi and dpiFind moved, merged, to Device's Mouse DPI card's
       "?" (09-overview.js ovDpiHTML) with the controls */
    feel: 'How your aim stops when your hand stops.<br><b>Snappy</b> stops the instant your hand does. '+
